# Architecture (frozen)

Rationale: `docs/decisions/`. Do not silently reverse.

- Two processes: `apps/api` (HTTP) + `apps/worker` (BullMQ). Modular monolith.
- Postgres: `events` + `metric_samples` + `request_rollups`. No ES/ClickHouse.
- Ingest: one `POST /api/v1/ingest` batch. Queue-first **202**. Redis down → **503 + Retry-After**.
- Alerts: scheduled on rollups, never on ingest HTTP or per-event persist.
- Dashboard: poll 10–15s. No WebSockets. SSE only if explicitly requested after Phase 5.
- RBAC: `owner | admin | member | viewer`. Org created on signup.
- Error groups + fingerprint in MVP.
- p95 from histogram / short-window percentile, not raw 7-day scans.

Details: `docs/architecture/overview.md`, `ingestion.md`, `processing-and-queues.md`, `alerting-and-notifications.md`.
